# Never upload build artifacts to Vercel.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: `dashboard/out/` is a stale static export left over from
# when this app used `output: "export"`. The repo-root vercel.json pointed
# `outputDirectory` at it, so `vercel --prod` run from the repo root uploaded
# that folder and SERVED IT VERBATIM — a build from hours earlier, with no
# /api/chat route, no server, and stale figures — while reporting success.
# The deploy was green and the site was wrong.
#
# Vercel builds from source. Any pre-built output in the upload is either
# ignored or, as here, actively harmful.
dashboard/out/
dashboard/.next/
dashboard/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Local Python artifacts — nothing the dashboard build needs.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
solution/output/
output/

# Local scratch that should never reach a deployment.
submission_pack_jeff_davison/
Mindex_Submission_Attachments_*/
*.zip
INTERVIEW_QA.md
VERIFICATION_REPORT.md
